Package: rummage
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, shared-mime-info, hicolor-icon-theme,
 libheif1 (>= 1.23), libheif-plugin-libde265 (>= 1.23)
Suggests: rummage-photos, rummage-font, rummage-model, tokei
Conflicts: rummage-media, rummage-pdf, rummage-previews
Replaces: rummage-media, rummage-pdf, rummage-previews
Description: Native Wayland file manager
 A file manager with column and grid views, isolated previews, configurable
 custom actions and an optional desktop file chooser portal.

Package: rummage-photos
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, rummage (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Photo Library for rummage
 Optional local photo catalog and organisation. Originals remain in place.
 Removing this package preserves the user's catalog and annotations.

Package: rummage-font
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, rummage (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Optional font specimens for rummage
 Isolated scalable TrueType/OpenType specimens using system FreeType.

Package: rummage-model
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, rummage (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Optional 3D model previews for rummage
 Isolated standalone geometry previews using system Assimp.
